    {
      "id": "8dab4561-fc7c-4576-925f-81f299448dbe",
      "title": "Escute a frase e associe a forma a uma tarefa simples da casa.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "5143b844-4e99-4047-866d-2d67110ddaa0",
          "textContent": "<p>Observe outra frase.</p><p><strong>Yo hago la cama.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Eu arrumo a cama.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
